Brief Introduction About Myself

My name is Keabetswe Mashiloane, and I am a passionate and hardworking individual with a strong interest in the culinary industry. I completed my Professional Chef Programme at Capsicum Culinary Studio and have gained valuable experience working as a Junior Chef at Siyathemba In-Flight Catering. Through my training and work experience, I have developed skills in food preparation, teamwork, time management, and maintaining high standards of food safety and hygiene.

I enjoy learning new cooking techniques and working in fast-paced environments where I can grow both personally and professionally. I am dedicated, adaptable, and always willing to take on new challenges. My goal is to continue improving my culinary skills while contributing positively to any team or organization I work with.
